{
  "_about": "The five guns. Units: damage in health points, rate_ms between shots, speed_cms in cm/s, spread_deg the half-angle of the cone a shot may stray in, size_cm the shot's radius, life_ms how long it flies, splash_cm the radius of the blast and splash its damage, pierce how many enemies a shot passes through. Every number the Codex and the HUD show for a gun is computed from these by crates/core/src/codex.rs. Levels 1 to 4: a run finds higher levels on side paths; level 4 only in the house. A saw gun (saws > 0) throws a blade on each press while it has one in hand: saws blades out at once, each dealing damage on impact and, while the trigger is held, rev_damage every rev_ms until it has dealt teeth in all; then it comes back in recall_ms. from_zone: the first zone (counted from 0) whose rewards offer the gun. alt: the gun's second fire on the right mouse button: kind burst (count heavy rounds one behind another), slug (one heavy round that pierces), cluster (count bombs in a fan, spread_deg apart) or detonate (every lodged blade bursts for damage plus half its teeth left, splash_cm round it, and comes back); damage at level 1, 25% more each level above; cooldown_ms between uses. mag and shell_ms: a revolver's cylinder and the time to load one round into it; it loads one shell at a time once the trigger has been let be a moment (at once when empty). Alt kind fan: every round left, one after another, a little wild.",
